            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[- Fixed automatic updates: earlier versions' updater could not run, so this one has to be installed by hand (download, replace Karui in Applications); updates work from here on
- The Dock icon and the menu bar item show the unread count; turn it off under Settings
- Sender has its own column in the compact view, sortable and movable like the others
]]></description>
