            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[- Sync Now in the Notifications menu (⌘R) asks your iPhone to send its History right away and fetches the day's verdicts
- A new app icon without the badge, so the Dock no longer looks like something is unread
- The unread column can be moved like the others, and its place is remembered
- Column widths leave more room for the notification text
]]></description>
